      <para unique="1092023">AVX512F) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+519967"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092025">Subtract packed double precision floating-point values from ymm3/m256/m64bcst to ymm2 and store result in ymm1 with writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1091993">EVEX.512.66.0F.W1 5C /r</para>
